{
  "sequence_id": "seq_4e5d126a68879ddf",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well, not that it has anything to do with servants like us,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "That's even better for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SFX: Third"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I have the perfect medicine for the bride."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh, please. My goodness!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "But can I see?                                                          "
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Of course. Here."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Wow! So many! :)"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It is almost time for you to depart."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Take good care of his parents."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "be mindful of your health."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yeah, we're counting on you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The future of the Sakai family now rests in your hands."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Maybe you should sell them to Lady Mao!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": ".........."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Her groom, Lord Shiono, is..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That's rather unfortunate for the bride."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But it can't be helped."
    }
  ],
